      "text": "int num = 9;           // Size: 4 bytes | Range: -2^31 to 2^31 - 1\nbyte by = 127;         // Size: 1 byte  | Range: -2^7 to 2^7 - 1\nshort sh = 558;        // Size: 2 bytes | Range: -2^15 to 2^15 - 1\nlong l = 5854L;        // Size: 8 bytes | Range: -2^63 to 2^63 - 1\n\nfloat f = 5.8f;        // 4 bytes  → Range: ~±3.4e38 (7 decimal digits precision)\ndouble d = 5.8;        // 8 bytes  → Range: ~±1.7e308 (15 decimal digits precision)\n\nchar c = 'a';          // Size: 2 bytes | Range: 0 to 2^16 - 1 (Unicode values)\n\nboolean b = true;      // Size: ~1 bit (depends on JVM) | Values: true / false ",
